{"type":"message","id":"849b2c97","parentId":"27026a1e","timestamp":"2026-03-21T00:29:12.299Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Saturday, March 21st, 2026 — 12:29 AM (UTC) / 2026-03-21 00:29 UTC"}],"timestamp":1774052952296}}
{"type":"message","id":"ff48bf71","parentId":"849b2c97","timestamp":"2026-03-21T00:29:39.721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The session startup sequence requires reading SOUL.md and BOOTSTRAP.md to establish my persona and greeting approach before responding to the user.\n</think>\n\nHey. I just came online. Who am I? Who are you?\n\nLet's figure out who we both are, then talk about what matters — your preferences, boundaries, anything that makes this feel real. What do you want to do?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774052952298}}
{"type":"message","id":"d962b430","parentId":"ff48bf71","timestamp":"2026-03-21T00:30:08.415Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"2505\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"sender\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-03-21 00:30 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Klaus Ampler (8437938758)\",\n  \"id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"name\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"username\": \"klausampler\"\n}\n```\n\nOk lets fogot everything before and start brsnd new project ok?\n\nlets say we gonna create an application which will be able to scrape and keep fresh data from livesport.cz. Into some kind of db/cache. from where our UI will be showing it. I am only interested in LIVE football matches.\n\nu as a CEO should manage this project, step by step.\n\nIf you will miss some premissions or you will need some clarification let me know.\n\nwe dont need to persist data, cache is fine. as UI lets start with simple web dashboard"}],"timestamp":1774053008412}}
{"type":"message","id":"720fe127","parentId":"d962b430","timestamp":"2026-03-21T00:30:32.881Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The user wants to start fresh with a new project - a live football match scraper. I need to spawn the coder agent to handle the implementation work, delegating the technical setup while I manage as the CEO orchestrator.\n</think>\n\nGot it — fresh start, new project. We'll build a live football match dashboard: scrap livesport.cz, cache it in memory/cache, and show it in a simple web dashboard.\n\nI'll manage this project step by step. First, I need to spawn the coder agent to create the technical plan and implementation.\n\n<tool_call>\n<function=sessions_spawn>\n<parameter=deliver>\nfalse\n</parameter>\n<parameter=label>\nfootball-scrape-coder\n</parameter>\n<parameter=mode>\nrun\n</parameter>\n<parameter=runtime>\nsubagent\n</parameter>\n<parameter=task>\nCreate a live football match scraper for livesport.cz with:\n\n1. Research livesport.cz structure and find football match endpoints\n2. Build a scraper that fetches live matches only\n3. Create an in-memory cache that refreshes every X seconds\n4. Build a simple web dashboard (Flask/FastAPI) showing live matches\n5. Display: teams,"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774053008415}}
